{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d962955d53414387f5f4e2902c3fd27dd8521baa5a472ba42563213570fae1a0","ja":"もうそんなタイミングですか！\nでは、行ってきます！","zh":"已经到这个时候了吗！\n那么，我出发了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"57a1942478f71b25e26ac87e76638a94eb2318090de43b6f79f3116c4b599b4c","ja":"伴田さん、ストップです。\nそれはペンです。マイクではありません。","zh":"伴田小姐，请停一下。\n那是笔，不是麦克风。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ffa2942e6b11147bd7954dee52c0a8acfdfb19081777ff9b846cb8d2be806905","ja":"わわっ！　あ、危ないところでした……。\nソーリー＆サンキューですミズキ！","zh":"哇哇！差、差点就危险了……\nSorry＆Thank you，瑞希！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"16bbf057e1817a8af676aa5bf367b53e510845cd42d2e7af95703b054a980e89","ja":"聴いていただき、ありがとうございました！\n引き続き、ライブを楽しんでくださいね！","zh":"感谢大家的收听！\n请继续享受演唱会吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4147f5dd5a2144d720695040afc43b33ab3363200942ad193418474bf0304ce5","ja":"ロコ達はまた戻ってきますよ！\nシーユーアゲインです！","zh":"ROCO她们还会再回来的哦！\nSee you again！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ccd8fc8c24f37e0d2e55453a5196e73dbb9c51674ec899f5fbef6f10de705c1e","ja":"戻りました！\nえっと、私の担当はあと25枚でしたっけ！？","zh":"我回来了！\n那个，我负责的还有25张来着吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6a16c7f9f8a7b99917bee5ebb0ec8d1abd17ac53d271821bc5ceb9a85d86b41c","ja":"百合子ちゃん、逆よ逆！　残りはあと15枚！\n焦らないで大丈夫、まだ時間はあるから。ね？","zh":"百合子，反了反了！还剩下最后15张！\n不用着急没关系的，时间还很充裕。好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"adbeb0e66419dbf53f13804c26802eaef66a8a834154dbb986139858820a1062","ja":"シズカは何を書いてるのですか？","zh":"静香在写什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"48160c97879c9cd32e011bfce74ea11d515e824784fb556f1ffc00785e15d492","ja":"スペースが余ったから、絵でも描こうかなと思って。\nここに……こんな感じで……っと♪","zh":"因为还有空位，就想画点画什么的。\n在这里……画成这样……好啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"21e23a09267fedc8fdd4c67e1aaae3eee9c1e3f7342e125d360ede964d9509ec","ja":"アメージングです！　さすがシズカ！\nとってもアーティスティックですね！","zh":"太惊艳了！不愧是静香！\n非常有艺术感呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"c5e5901a76941c48b820ca57d2e6a24df053dd551d1a7c6c5897085e44b4ee5e","ja":"ロコも良いことを思いつきました！　カードの裏側を、\nロコアートでデコレーションしちゃいます♪","zh":"ROCO也想到了一个好主意！这就用\nROCO艺术来装饰卡片的背面♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1542.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"38b7b92e7ad09126ada95ad456f4266de96fe39b39ef74b035a928ecb45392d4","ja":"わぁ、素敵！\nきっとみんな喜んでくれるわね！","zh":"哇，好棒！\n大家一定都会很高兴的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
